 class=\"ident\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-1-1\" data-name=\"document identity block\">\n<span class=\"kind-icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"document type icon badge\"><i class=\"fa-regular fa-file-lines\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"document file icon\"></i></span>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"document number info\">\n<strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"document reference number\">LV-2026-0014</strong>\n<small data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"document type and date\">ลาป่วย · ยื่น 10 พ.ย. 69</small>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-2\" data-name=\"leave details cell\">\n<strong class=\"leave-dates\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-2-1\" data-name=\"leave dates text\">12–13 พ.ย. 69 · 2 วัน</strong>\n<p class=\"reason\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-2-2\" data-name=\"reason for leave text\">ไข้หวัดใหญ่ มีใบรับรองแพทย์</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-3\" data-name=\"submitter cell\">\n<div class=\"submitter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-3-1\" data-name=\"submitter identity block\">\n<img alt=\"สมชาย ใจดี\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-3-1-1\" data-name=\"submitter avatar image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/60?u=somchai-jaidee\"/>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-3-1-2\" data-name=\"submitter info text\"><strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"submitter name\">สมชาย ใจดี</strong><small data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"submitter department\">การตลาด</small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"status-cell\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-4\" data-name=\"status cell\">\n<span class=\"chip approved\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-4-1\" data-name=\"approved status chip\">อนุมัติแล้ว</span>\n<span class=\"stage\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-4-2\" data-name=\"approval stage text\">ครบทุกขั้น · 13 พ.ย. 69</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hist\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-5\" data-name=\"empty history cell\"><span class=\"none\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6-5-1\" data-name=\"dash placeholder\">—</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7\" data-name=\"document row - approved leave request\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1\" data-name=\"document number cell\">\n<div class=\"ident\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1-1\" data-name=\"document identity block\">\n<span class=\"kind-icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"document type icon badge\"><i class=\"fa-regular fa-file-lines\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"document file icon\"></i></span>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"document number info\">\n<strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"document reference number\">LV-2026-0010</strong>\n<small data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"document type and date\">ลากิจ · ยื่น 3 พ.ย. 69</small>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-2\" data-name=\"leave details cell\">\n<strong class=\"leave-dates\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-2-1\" data-name=\"leave dates text\">6 พ.ย. 69 · 1 วัน</strong>\n<p class=\"reason\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-2-2\" data-name=\"reason for leave text\">ธุระครอบครัว</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-3\" data-name=\"submitter cell\">\n<div class=\"submitter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-3-1\" data-name=\"submitter identity block\">\n<img alt=\"วีระ ศรีสุข\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-3-1-1\" data-name=\"submitter avatar image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/60?u=weera-srisuk\"/>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-3-1-2\" data-name=\"submitter info text\"><strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"submitter name\">วีระ ศรีสุข</strong><small data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"submitter department\">การตลาด</small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"status-cell\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-4\" data-name=\"status cell\">\n<span class=\"chip approved\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-4-1\" data-name=\"approved status chip\">อนุมัติแล้ว</span>\n<span class=\"stage\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-4-2\" data-name=\"approval stage text\">ครบทุกขั้น · 5 พ.ย. 69</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hist\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-5\" data-name=\"empty history cell\"><span class=\"none\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-5-1\" data-name=\"dash placeholder\">—</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pager\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"table pagination bar\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"results count text\">แสดง 1–6 จาก 6 รายการ</span>\n<div class=\"pages\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"pagination controls\">\n<button class=\"pg size\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"items per page button\">10 รายการ/หน้า</button>\n<button class=\"pg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"previous page button\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron left icon\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"pg on\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"current page button\">1</button>\n<button class=\"pg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-4\" data-name=\"next page button\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-4-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>\n</div>",
